  "amends": "levine32_v1",
  "amendment": "Threshold rule changed after the v1 quick run (2 replicates) showed that the 2-GMM split the CyTOF zero spike from non-zero values (cuts ~0.02 for CD4/CD133/CD14/CD15/CD117), and that dBIC>=10 is uninformative at n~50k.  v2: values <= 0.05 are negative and excluded from the fit; 2-GMM on the rest; reliable iff Ashman's D >= 1.5 and upper weight >= 0.03 (D_min chosen after seeing the per-marker D diagnostic; textbook value 2 would drop 13/32 markers in mixed bone marrow).  Claims, splits, designs, budgets unchanged."
